[49.569481, "o", "\r\nHere is the prioritised audit report based on the actual state of the `broken-demo` charm:\r\n\r\n🔴 **Priority 1: Quality & Testing (Must Fix)**\r\n* **Zero Test Coverage:** The charm completely lacks both unit (`tests/unit/`) and integration (`tests/integration/`) tests.\r\n\r\n🟠 **Priority 2: Operations & Observability (Should Fix)**\r\n* **Dead Configuration:** The `log-level` config option is declared in `charmcraft.yaml` but never actually read or handled in the code.\r\n* **Blind Status Handling:** The charm does not set `BlockedStatus` for missing relations, missing configuration, or invalid configuration values.\r\n* **No COS Integration:** Missing standard observability relations (`metrics-endpoint`, `logging`, `grafana-dashboard`, `tracing`) and the `ops-tracing` instrumentation library.\r\n* **Missing Day-2 Actions:** Standard operational actions (`get-health`, `pause`, `resume`) are not implemented.\r\n* **Incomplete Metadata:** `charmcraft.yaml` is missing fundamental fields like `display-name` and `description`.\r\n* **Missing Base Documentation:** No `README.md` or basic setup instructions exist.\r\n\r\n🟡 **Priority 3: Best Practices & Charmhub Listing (Nice to Have)**\r\n* **Modern Ops Patterns:** The charm lacks modern reconciliation patterns (holistic status handling, basic config/relation event handlers).\r\n* **Missing Listing Assets:** Lacks `icon.svg`, a `LICENSE` file, and repository URLs (`docs`, `issues`, `source`).\r\n* **Missing Extended Docs:** No configuration, usage, or troubleshooting documentation.\r\n* **No TLS Support:** Lacks a `tls-certificates` relation for encryption in transit.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you would like to discuss any of these findings or if you are ready to begin addressing them.\r\n"]
[51.775069, "o", "\u001b[2;37m# \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2;37m# From here cantrip would queue fix tasks, branch, and apply them\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2;37m# in disposable subagents. Gate every step with /tasks confirm.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
